This directory is bind-mounted read-only into the standby wiki container at
/var/www/html/wiki-state. ./cirrus.sh creates and removes the single file
`cirrus-enabled` here; LocalSettings.php checks for it to decide whether to load
CirrusSearch or fall back to MySQL full-text. Keeping the switch in a host file
rather than in LocalSettings means the config text never changes when the
backend is toggled, and the setting survives a container recreate.
